{
  "name": "GD·08 CRM · follow-ups on stage changes",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·08 Follow-ups on stage changes (Boss 5 · D6b, 5.9 Card 4)\nEvery 15 min (the schedule alternative to the HubSpot Trigger): deals modified recently → \"first time at this stage?\" (crm_stage_seen, unique deal+stage) → the Card 4 task for that stage:\n- Tasting booked → task the day before next_step_date\n- Proposal sent → \"Follow up\" in 3 days\n- Won → onboarding task; contacts' lifecycle → Customer\n- Lost → \"add a lost reason\" if missing; \"current supplier\" → check in again in 6 months\nIt only creates tasks and updates contact lifecycle, NEVER the deal stage, so it can't trigger itself. Each stage change runs once.\n\nTable: crm_stage_seen(deal_id text, stage text, seen_at, primary key (deal_id, stage)).\n**Credentials:** HubSpot App Token, Postgres.\n**Replace:** YOUR_STAGE_TASTING_BOOKED, YOUR_STAGE_PROPOSAL_SENT (stage IDs; won/lost use closedwon/closedlost or your IDs).",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "52e72122-c648-423c-987d-78734aa81381",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b53e037f-c573-4d29-9afa-027f3863bdec",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/deals/search",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  filterGroups: [{ filters: [{ propertyName: 'hs_lastmodifieddate', operator: 'GTE', value: String(Date.now() - 20 * 60000) }] }],\n  properties: ['dealname', 'dealstage', 'hubspot_owner_id', 'next_step_date', 'lost_reason'],\n  limit: 100\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f658f73b-0ea3-4c7c-a3e1-7d6650c3278b",
      "name": "Recently changed deals",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "results",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "90273f38-7145-4e2b-8261-898552c44b13",
      "name": "One per deal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO crm_stage_seen (deal_id, stage, seen_at) VALUES ($1, $2, now())\nON CONFLICT (deal_id, stage) DO NOTHING\nRETURNING deal_id, stage;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.id, $json.properties.dealstage ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "5bc37ddb-6a0a-4b7e-af2c-2e44e627c64c",
      "name": "First time at this stage?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "94dd589a-0480-481b-97b4-feffc46a09b0",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.deal_id ?? '' }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cbde0601-fadd-4a83-88c7-7532f21a05bb",
      "name": "New stage only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Card 4. Stage IDs: replace with yours.\nconst STAGE = { tasting: 'YOUR_STAGE_TASTING_BOOKED', proposal: 'YOUR_STAGE_PROPOSAL_SENT', won: 'closedwon', lost: 'closedlost' };\nconst d = $('One per deal').item.json;\nconst p = d.properties;\nconst at = (days, hour = 9) => { const t = new Date(); t.setDate(t.getDate() + days); t.setHours(hour, 0, 0, 0); return t.toISOString(); };\nlet task = null, won = false;\nif (p.dealstage === STAGE.tasting) {\n  const day = p.next_step_date ? new Date(p.next_step_date) : null;\n  if (day) day.setDate(day.getDate() - 1);\n  task = { subject: 'Prepare tasting crate and confirm: ' + p.dealname, due: day ? day.toISOString() : at(1) };\n} else if (p.dealstage === STAGE.proposal) {\n  task = { subject: 'Follow up on proposal: ' + p.dealname, due: at(3) };\n} else if (p.dealstage === STAGE.won) {\n  task = { subject: 'Start onboarding (6.2) and welcome series: ' + p.dealname, due: at(0, 17) }; won = true;\n} else if (p.dealstage === STAGE.lost) {\n  if (!p.lost_reason) task = { subject: 'Add a lost reason: ' + p.dealname, due: at(0, 17) };\n  else if (/current supplier/i.test(p.lost_reason)) task = { subject: 'Check in again (lost to current supplier): ' + p.dealname, due: at(182) };\n}\nreturn { json: { deal_id: d.id, stage: p.dealstage, owner: p.hubspot_owner_id || 'YOUR_HUBSPOT_OWNER_ID', task, won } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "26226a0d-537f-423b-bda6-6d6420cbb78e",
      "name": "Task for this stage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
